# Preferences

Read by the scorer alongside profile.md. Three sections:

- `## Manual` — rules you write yourself. Yours alone: `jobhunt rate` never edits or reorders
  them, and the rules it writes are told not to contradict them.
- `## Learned` — general patterns inferred from your ratings, rewritten by `jobhunt rate`.
- `## Specifics` — narrow one-off inferences (a single employer, method or caveat), also
  rewritten by `jobhunt rate`.

Don't hand-edit the last two; anything you want kept belongs in `## Manual`.

